<div class="entry-content single-content">
	
<p class="wp-block-paragraph">How high should you mount a TV? This free <strong>TV mounting height calculator</strong> gives you the answer in two taps: pick your TV size and where you sit, and it shows how high the center, bottom and top of the screen should be from the floor.</p>



<p class="wp-block-paragraph">It works in inches or centimeters, handles sofas, beds and standing spots, and warns you if a fireplace or piece of furniture forces the TV too high. Open <em>More options</em> to enter your own eye height and viewing distance, or the height for the wall bracket.</p>



<div id="dsh-tvh" class="dsh-calc">

<h3>How high should you mount your TV?</h3>
<p class="sub">Two taps: pick your TV size and where you sit. The answer appears straight away.</p>
